astating cataclysms\u2014and evacuate the planet alive.<br><br><strong>God's Objective:</strong><br>Destroy the Marines by strategically choosing the best spells, wisely managing mana, setting traps, summoning creatures, and controlling the elements.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/62c5cdfcde59e58e64fc65bbc6ccd795.avif?t=1752486823\" width=800 height=128 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/fa2442a1eee42292df4cfe036ef1eeb5.webp?t=1752486823\" width=24 height=24 /></span> <strong>Zombie Summon</strong> \u2014 attacks nearby Marines.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/3b5b72475438d54f4332cf795b2d6b03.webp?t=1752486823\" width=24 height=24 /></span> <strong>Psionic Storm</strong> \u2014 deals lightning damage over an area.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/d5f905e2b7489c836a70b6c80369b20c.webp?t=1752486823\" width=24 height=24 /></span> <strong>Illusion of Doubles</strong> \u2014 creates deceptive duplicates.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/7b551eed8a54c4047df06595af552473.webp?t=1752486823\" width=24 height=24 /></span> <strong>Fireball</strong> \u2014 deals massive damage after a short delay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/24b13c9b2dc53c10e6cd57feebd29b31.webp?t=1752486823\" width=24 height=24 /></span> <strong>Stone Barrier</strong> \u2014 creates a wall at the chosen location.<br><br><strong>And many more!</strong><br><i>Each spell reshapes the battlefield\u2014adapt your tactics to match your playstyle!</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209950/extras/346443da32cccc4d38ee8845dc7edbbb.avif?t=1752486823\" width=800 height=128 /></span><br><br><strong>Each planet is unique and full of secrets:</strong><br>\u2022 Martian Wastelands<br>\u2022 City of the Future<br>\u2022 Jungle Labyrinth<br>\u2022 Ice Fortress<br>\u2022 Abandoned Civilization<br><br><strong>Choose Your God:</strong><br>Zeus, Demon Lord, Anar Dreams<br><br><strong>Choose Your Marine:</strong><br>Defender, Sniper, Medic, or Engineer<br><br><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong><br>Classic asymmetric mode (4vs1)\u2014God versus the Marines squad.<br>PvP, PvE, cooperative, and mixed modes with friends or against AI (up to 8 players).",
